  "description": "Don't let a profit turn to a bag. Period.",
  "body_html": "<p>This is just a quick heads up: FedEx came down was the announcement of Amazon launching their supply chain services.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> Normally, I ignore the news…however, I have watched Amazon destroy small (and large) businesses for nearly 30 years now. Betting against Amazon is historically a bad decision. Just something to keep an eye on. As long as price action doesnt break much further, and/or we stay in profit, then nothing to worry about. But monitor this. </p><p>I saw in the main chat, questions about “<strong>why oil prices are not rocketing.</strong>” If you are new here, I have been pretty bearish on oil for the last ~4 years, and posted 2 months ago that <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-oil-trap?r=4z8lgl\">Oil is a retail investor trap</a>, which has been aging well. The predominant reasons include but are not limited to (and I am keeping this short and sweet): </p><ol><li><p>Oil rigs have been declining, which are highly correlated to oil price action. </p></li><li><p>Macro trend for oil prices have been declining.</p></li><li><p>The U.S. has been in some form of engagement with the Middle East for decades…Iran and the Strait of Hormuz is just another to add to the list. </p></li><li><p>I talked less about this, but <strong>price elasticity</strong>. When something gets more expensive, you are less likely to buy it. For example, if gas goes up, you will likely drive less. Or if a cheeseburger used to cost $5, but now $10, you will likely eat less of them. Too many people are assuming that demand for oil will remain constant, but it does not.</p></li></ol><p>Credit to <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Robin J Brooks&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:177174254,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/df3bce00-324d-4420-8b1b-07b1b1a0220a_344x344.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8aba007c-1e9e-44c6-b77b-dd3508893cec&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> and his article “<a href=\"https://robinjbrooks.substack.com/p/how-high-will-oil-prices-go\">How high will oil prices go</a>”, he has an incredible graph of <strong>price elasticity</strong>, tanker traffic and oil prices. You can see that yes… prices of $180 or $160 are not off the table…but they are unlikely. We would need several <em><strong>severe</strong></em> shocks or catalysts to drive prices up that high. Possible…but unlikely. Note: I do not know Robin personally, but appreciated his article and the graph below. I hate when people steal my work with no credit. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png\" width=\"473\" height=\"417\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:417,&quot;width&quot;:473,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1n_D!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c1f5a13-589f-4be5-a69b-d9d026de75f2_473x417.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The rest of the market seems to be doing fine…a sluggish, yet positive start to the week. As I mentioned last week, when and if we start to see momentum or breakouts, we will commence doubling down and or buying more assets. Until then, have a great Monday! </p><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-